THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS AND DATA

The following are not owned by the Author and remain subject to their own terms:

- ISSprOM 2019-2 symbol set file
  (CakraPencil/Resources/SymbolSets/BOF O_Map 4000 O12 v1_ISSprOM2019-2.ocd):
  OCAD symbol set published by British Orienteering (BOF). The ISOM and ISSprOM
  mapping specifications are published by the International Orienteering
  Federation (IOF).
- Apple Maps / MapKit imagery and map data, used under Apple's terms: shown as
  a tracing reference, cached per device as an image of the locked map area,
  and included in exports only when the user turns on "Include basemap" (with
  an Apple Maps credit). Users are responsible for complying with Apple's terms
  when sharing such exports.
- Elevation data from the "Terrain Tiles" open dataset (AWS Open Data, Mapzen;
  sources include SRTM, GMTED, NED, ETOPO1 and others), downloaded at runtime to
  generate contours. See https://registry.opendata.aws/terrain-tiles/ for
  attribution requirements.
- Apple system frameworks (SwiftUI, UIKit, MapKit, PencilKit, CoreLocation,
  ImageIO, Compression, GameController) under the Apple Developer agreements.

The Software contains no third-party open-source source code.
